{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And Lamech said to his wives.</b> From his words that he said to them — <b>Hear my voice</b> — we learn that they were vexed with him, and he said to them: why do you not listen to me? And <b>for I have killed a man</b> — to my wound, with surprise." "<b>האזנה (give ear).</b> Pointed with a ḥiriq."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:59.426280717Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}